+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: fast Walsh--Hadamard inversion solves this distribution in "
+        "O(n log n); at the shipping preset it uses 24,576 counted exact/bit "
+        "operations and averaged 0.017180 seconds over eight measured runs, whereas the signed-code "
+        "and rank-one-shear route uses 110 exact arithmetic operations."
